# CR 702.2b: Pitiless Gorgon (2/2, Deathtouch) attacks; Devoted
# Hero (1/2, no keywords) blocks. Any nonzero deathtouch damage is
# lethal regardless of toughness (destroyDamagedCreatures,
# action.go), so Hero always dies here even though its 2 toughness
# would survive Pitiless Gorgon's own 2 power without the keyword.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged creature(s) to the graveyard.
advance
